      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here should be refactored as well. After this patch. revocation list API \"GET /auth/tokens/OS-PKI/revoked\" will return 500 error due to \"Provider object has no attribute _persistence\".\n\nI wonder that if we can remove this API as well.",
